 "file": "story/spt/free03_01_02_04_t024.spt",
 "lines": [
  {
   "i": 1041,
   "src": "c12c268fadf2",
   "t": "{{ryoma}}"
  },
  {
   "i": 1052,
   "src": "f3fc209df00f",
   "t": "...Dang, I thought I'd finally"
  },
  {
   "i": 1055,
   "src": "be0b0f2cdf4c",
   "t": "found the back entrance."
  },
  {
   "i": 1063,
   "src": "abdff9d6b01a",
   "t": "Back entrance..."
  },
  {
   "i": 1074,
   "src": "ccce830957ef",
   "t": "So the front entrance is the cave past"
  },
  {
   "i": 1077,
   "src": "ff383270171a",
   "t": "the duct from the storehouse?"
  },
  {
   "i": 1082,
   "src": "1e52ed43bbf1",
   "t": "{{mio}}"
  },
  {
   "i": 1091,
   "src": "f8aea04d82a0",
   "t": "The one where a weird {{medabot}} attacks\nif you get close?"
  },
  {
   "i": 1101,
   "src": "c12c268fadf2",
   "t": "{{ryoma}}"
  },
  {
   "i": 1110,
   "src": "ddcf0ae44096",
   "t": "Right."
  },
  {
   "i": 1118,
   "src": "f0717d4ae09b",
   "t": "But given the size of the mine,"
  },
  {
   "i": 1121,
   "src": "33d8c0688bea",
   "t": "that couldn't have been the only\nentrance."
  },
  {
   "i": 1129,
   "src": "6175f23bd991",
   "t": "There must have been shafts all over\nthe island,"
  },
  {
   "i": 1132,
   "src": "3597db59b685",
   "t": "with small mine entrances here and\nthere."
  },
  {
   "i": 1140,
   "src": "0900c860f958",
   "t": "With that in mind, I walked all over..."
  },
  {
   "i": 1143,
   "src": "f271af653a8b",
   "t": "but I couldn't even find a trace."
  },
  {
   "i": 1154,
   "src": "6d8a1e48b2fd",
   "t": "This is the one I finally found."
  },
  {
   "i": 1157,
   "src": "c8127c979ad4",
   "t": "I'm sure they buried the rest when the\nmine closed."
  },
  {
   "i": 1167,
   "src": "1e52ed43bbf1",
   "t": "{{mio}}"
  },
  {
   "i": 1176,
   "src": "264dae2f314f",
   "t": "Buried? On purpose?"
  },
  {
   "i": 1179,
   "src": "b90f97af3597",
   "t": "What for?"
  },
  {
   "i": 1193,
   "src": "c12c268fadf2",
   "t": "{{ryoma}}"
  },
  {
   "i": 1202,
   "src": "55cd72a49099",
   "t": "I don't know. But no records from that\ntime"
  },
  {
   "i": 1205,
   "src": "260a0f5980e4",
   "t": "turn up no matter how much I search."
  },
  {
   "i": 1213,
   "src": "f0cc89c8cfd6",
   "t": "Maybe there's something they want to\nhide."
  },
  {
   "i": 1216,
   "src": "a5461642e849",
   "t": "It must be connected to that accident..."
  },
  {
   "i": 1224,
   "src": "74b625505d5f",
   "t": "An accident!"
  },
  {
   "i": 1227,
   "src": "b7846cbaf882",
   "t": "Does that mean--"
  },
  {
   "i": 1235,
   "src": "c12c268fadf2",
   "t": "{{ryoma}}"
  },
  {
   "i": 1241,
   "src": "e0795a244490",
   "t": "Shh."
  }
 ]
}
